% oracle: colour
% Scenario: a monitor-like piecewise space converts to Lab. The decode
% procedures are a linear toe under a power curve, so the space does not
% collapse (a gamma would); a mid grey and the space's red are set and
% filled, each converted through the procedures and the matrix.
[/CIEBasedABC <<
  /WhitePoint [0.95 1 1.09]
  /DecodeABC [
    { dup 0.05 le { 12 div } { 0.06 add 1.06 div 2.2 exp } ifelse } bind
    { dup 0.05 le { 12 div } { 0.06 add 1.06 div 2.2 exp } ifelse } bind
    { dup 0.05 le { 12 div } { 0.06 add 1.06 div 2.2 exp } ifelse } bind
  ]
  /MatrixABC [0.41 0.21 0.02  0.36 0.72 0.12  0.18 0.07 0.95]
>>] setcolorspace
0.5 0.5 0.5 setcolor
100 100 200 100 rectfill
1 0 0 setcolor
100 300 200 100 rectfill
showpage
